    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to announce 5 Palmerstown Heights to the market, a superb four-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home with a south-facing rear garden, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Palmerstown Heights Estate.\r\n\r\nThe property offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout, providing an excellent opportunity for those looking to create a wonderful family home in a mature and well-established residential setting.\r\n\r\nThe property is approached via a welcoming front porch, leading into a spacious entrance hallway. The ground floor comprises a large living room, an open-plan kitchen/dining area, guest WC and useful storage room. A sliding door provides direct access to the rear garden, allowing plenty of natural light to flow throughout the living space.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is fully fitted with a range of units and provides an excellent setting for both everyday family living and entertaining, while also offering scope for future modernisation to suit individual tastes and requirements.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a sunny, south-facing garden which is low maintenance and offers excellent potential for outdoor entertaining and family use. The property also benefits from a large covered side entrance, providing valuable additional storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a high-quality timber-floored landing provides access to four well-proportioned bedrooms. The impressive master bedroom benefits from a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms offer excellent flexibility for family living. A spacious, fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally located in the ever-popular Palmerstown area of Dublin 20, with a host of amenities within easy reach. Local shops, schools, bars, restaurants and recreational facilities are all close by, while excellent transport links provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The N4, M4, M50, N7 and M8 are all readily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\r\n\r\n5 Palmerstown Heights represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious four-bedroom family home with great potential to modernise and personalise, in a mature and highly convenient residential setting. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: 1.96 m × 5.25 m\r\nWith carpet flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nLiving Room: 3.32 m × 5.66 m\r\nWith carpet flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nDining Room: 2.71 m × 3.47 m\r\nWith carpet flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nDining Area: 2.58 m × 3.24 m\r\nWith wooden flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nKitchen: 2.58 m × 3.31 m\r\nWith a range of floor & eye level fitted presses, tiled flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nBathroom: 0.75 m × 1.46 m\r\nWith WC, WHB & pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom1: 2.66 m × 4.28 m\r\nWith carpet flooring, built in wardrobes & pendant lighting.\r\nEnsuite: 2.66 m × 0.89 m\r\nWith tiled flooring/partially tiled walls, WC, WHB, shower.\r\nBedroom 2: 2.66 m × 3.86 m\r\nWith carpet flooring, pendant lighting & built in wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3 : 2.05 m × 2.76 m\r\nWith carpet flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nBedroom4 : 2.63 m × 2.08 m\r\nWith carpet flooring & pendant lighting.\r\nBathroom: 1.65 m × 2.22 m\r\nWith tiled flooring/walls, WC, WHB, shower/bath\r\nHallway: 2.63 m × 3.78 m\r\nWith carpet flooring & built in wardrobes."
